{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773170989,"nonce":"RkFTlSVSpLpHN8RHLomUAdTFEJc=","title":"CDE template_graph race condition: registry empty on first enterSubgraph","message":"enterSubgraph checks _componentRegistry.get(nodeSpec.type)?.template_graph, but if useComponents has not finished loading when the user first double-clicks a CDE node, the registry is empty and the node gets createEmptySubgraph instead of its template. Fix: guard enterSubgraph so that if the registry is empty and the node type is composite, it either defers or returns a loading state rather than silently creating an empty subgraph.","files":null}]}